{"verb": "cheer up", "audio": "audio/51 - feelings/01-cheer-up.mp3", "duration": 34.273, "transcript": "A children\\'s hospital in Houston has launched a new program designed to cheer up young patients during long treatments. Volunteer artists visit each room with paints, beads, and origami paper, helping kids create small projects to take home. Doctors say the activity reduces stress and helps families talk about difficult topics. The program now runs in three languages and is supported by local craft stores. A similar idea will start at two more hospitals next year.", "words": [{"word": "A", "start": 0.1, "end": 0.14, "score": 0.841}, {"word": "children\\'s", "start": 0.18, "end": 0.601, "score": 0.882}, {"word": "hospital", "start": 0.661, "end": 1.122, "score": 0.813}, {"word": "in", "start": 1.242, "end": 1.322, "score": 0.964}, {"word": "Houston", "start": 1.402, "end": 1.843, "score": 0.704}, {"word": "has", "start": 1.983, "end": 2.183, "score": 0.721}, {"word": "launched", "start": 2.284, "end": 2.644, "score": 0.796}, {"word": "a", "start": 2.744, "end": 2.784, "score": 0.662}, {"word": "new", "start": 2.864, "end": 3.025, "score": 0.879}, {"word": "program", "start": 3.085, "end": 3.545, "score": 0.796}, {"word": "designed", "start": 3.866, "end": 4.307, "score": 0.827}, {"word": "to", "start": 4.447, "end": 4.587, "score": 0.816}, {"word": "cheer", "start": 4.667, "end": 4.928, "score": 0.721}, {"word": "up", "start": 5.008, "end": 5.128, "score": 0.648}, {"word": "young", "start": 5.228, "end": 5.448, "score": 0.751}, {"word": "patients", "start": 5.528, "end": 5.969, "score": 0.878}, {"word": "during", "start": 6.129, "end": 6.47, "score": 0.801}, {"word": "long", "start": 6.57, "end": 6.851, "score": 0.792}, {"word": "treatments.", "start": 6.951, "end": 7.431, "score": 0.886}, {"word": "Volunteer", "start": 8.193, "end": 8.753, "score": 0.806}, {"word": "artists", "start": 8.834, "end": 9.234, "score": 0.807}, {"word": "visit", "start": 9.414, "end":